INSERT INTO `dutyfree_product` VALUES (1,'Black Label Aged 12 Year Old Blended Scotch Whisky',4400.00,'Johnnie Walker Black Label is the worlds No 1 Blended Scotch Whisky. A true icon it is recognised as the benchmark for all other deluxe blended whiskies. It is sweetness wrapped in a signature Johnnie Walker smoke finish. The blend is created using only whiskies aged for a minimum of 12 years from the four corners of Scotland. JW Black Label has an unmistakably smooth, deep character. It is a gentle embrace of sweet fruit and creamy toffee with a crackling smoky finish. An impressive whisky to share on any occasion, whether you\'re entertaining at home or on a night out with friends. A true icon recognized as the benchmark for other deluxe blends. Blended Scotch Whisky created using only whiskies aged for a minimum of 12 years from the four corners of Scotland. Enjoy it on the rocks, with a dash of still or sparkling water or serve it in a tall glass as a unique Johnnie highball with the mixer like lemonade, ginger ale or peach iced tea, for an electric burst of bite and flavours. Serve on any occasion. This award-winning scotch whisky is an impressive gift for someone who appreciates smooth and smoky whiskies. The perfect gift to taste!','product_images/jw.png',500,1,1,'','Johnnie Walker',NULL),(2,'Red Label Blended Scotch Whisky',2250.00,'The world’s best-selling Blended Scotch Whisky combines up to 35 single malt and grain whiskies, including many of Scotland’s most celebrated pours: Cardhu, Caol Ila, Cameronbridge and Teaninich. Sweet smoke crackles with sparks of cinnamon, honey cascades over fresh fruit while pepper bursts through crisp apple, these are the iconic flavours of Johnnie Walker Red Label. Created with long drinks in mind, it’s perfect to be enjoyed as a highball, in a tall glass filled with ice and mixed with lemonade, ginger ale or a mixer of your choice. A great gift for someone who appreciates good whisky and tasty long mixed drinks. The world’s best-selling Scotch whisky. Every bottle is the delicious result of blending up to 35 single malt and grain whiskies. Sweet smoke and crackles with sparks of cinnamon; honey cascaded over fresh fruit while pepper bursts through crisp apple. Made for mixing; combines vibrant whiskies, hand selected for their bold flavours Perfect to be enjoyed at home as a Johnnie Highball, served in a tall glass filled with ice and mixed with lemonade, ginger ale or a mixer of your choice. A great gift for someone who appreciates good whisky and tasty, long mixed drinks.','product_images/jw2.png',200,1,1,'','Johnnie Walker',NULL),(3,'Vsop Médaillon Cognac France',7500.00,'Established in 1715, Martell is the oldest of the great cognac houses. Martell VSOP Médaillon is a cognac that is made with skillfully blended, mature eaux-de-vie from the four finest growths of the Cognac region. Aged in French oak casks, those eaux-de-vie are selected by the cellar master to yield a perfect balance of freshness and crisp-edged sweetness.\r\nMartell Vsop Médaillon Cognac France, reserve online and collect from our Bengaluru duty free store before you travel.\r\n\r\nExplore our extensive range of beauty, liquor and food when you reserve your duty free order online. Find the main Martell products available to purchase and reserve at Bengaluru airport.\r\n\r\nWith up to the benefit of 1000s more products available when you reserve in advance, enjoy shopping tax and duty free products online with more choice, and without the rush! Reserve online, collect and pay in store.','product_images/m.png',50,1,1,'','Martell',NULL),(4,'Super Rich Repair',9070.00,'An AGE-fighting ultra-nourishing moisturiser designed to combat chronically dry, dehydrated skin while replenishing critical moisture levels. Powerful peptides help stimulate collagen production while an acid-free smoothing complex helps improve elasticity and tone. Use as a protective salve to shield against cold, dry environmental conditions. Directions: Following your Dermalogica Double Cleanse and Prescribed Dermalogica Toner apply 1-2 pumps to face and neck. Avoid the eye area. Can be used am and pm. Formulated without artificial fragrances and colours.\r\nDermalogica Super Rich Repair, reserve online and collect from our Bengaluru duty free store before you travel.\r\n\r\nExplore our extensive range of beauty, liquor and food when you reserve your duty free order online. Find the main Dermalogica products available to purchase and reserve at Bengaluru airport.\r\n\r\nWith up to the benefit of 1000s more products available when you reserve in advance, enjoy shopping tax and duty free products online with more choice, and without the rush! Reserve online, collect and pay in store.','product_images/b1.png',10,1,2,'','Dermalogica',NULL),(5,'Micro Essence Treatment Lotion With Bioferment',12300.00,'Activate and strengthen your skin’s foundation for a more stable barrier with this next-generation essence lotion. Powered with our advancedfermentation and special technology, it penetrates rapidly. Renews. Balances. Helps transform the look of your skin instantly and restore translucency.Nourishes with essential metabolites and nutrients to help skin activate its natural resistance to visible signs of aging. Intensely hydrates to minimizethe appearance of dry pores and reduce the look of fine, dry lines. Awaken youthful, healthylooking skin. Softer and smoother. Glowing with astunning vitality. Normal to dry skin will love it.','product_images/b2_5onbjGt.png',5,1,2,'','Estée Lauder',NULL),(6,'Rocher',1780.00,'30 premium Ferrero Rocher pralines in the best selling sophisticated gifting transparent packaging.','product_images/sw1.png',20,1,9,'','Ferrero',NULL),(7,'Minis Pouch',1650.00,'A bag full of delicious Bounty bars in a mini format. Share them with all your friends or family - there\'s plenty to go round.\r\nBounty Minis Pouch, reserve online and collect from our Bengaluru duty free','product_images/sw2.png',100,1,9,'','Bounty',NULL),(8,'Davidoff Cool Water Oceanic Edition Eau de Toilette for Women, 100ml (3.3oz)',4650.00,'','product_images/d.png',10,1,10,'','Davidoff',NULL),(9,'Bacardi Reserva Ocho Rye Cask Finish Rum 1L',6290.00,'Bacardi Reserva Ocho Rye Cask Finish Rum 1L is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. Bacardí Reserva Ocho Rye Cask Rum is a limited-edition rare rum blend, c A must-have for travelers—shop at Delhi Duty Free. – a must-have.','product_images/ba.jpg',10,1,1,'','BACARDI',NULL),(10,'Bowmore 16 Year Old Travel Exclusive 70cl',9990.00,'An elegant, complex and captivating whisky that deftly marries a tender, enchanting sweetness to a backdrop of dark, misty woodsmoke. This expressive travel exclusive reveals an intriguing dimension of mature fruitiness, from its Douro Valley casks. This expressive and adventurous 16-Year Old travel exclusive offer autumnal sweetness, tenderly enhanced by Bowmore\'s signature style. It reveals an intriguing dimension of mature fruitiness, derived from casks sourced from one of the most storied Port houses in the Douru Valley. Matured in American Oak ex-Bourbon and European Oak Sherry casks, our 16 Year Old is then finished to perfection in Ruby Port casks. A masterclass of intention.','product_images/bo16.jpg',5,1,1,'','Bowmore',NULL),(11,'Chivas Regal 18 Year Old',11590.00,'Chivas Regal 18 Year Old is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. Premium aged mix of some of Scotland\'s finest whiskies with an above-averag Enjoy this premium selection, only at Delhi Duty Free.','product_images/18.jpg',5,1,1,'','Chivas Regal',NULL),(12,'Burberry Her 50 Ml',8700.00,'Burberry Her Eau de Parfum Intense is a bold, sophisticated fragrance that deepens the original’s fruity floral signature. Rich notes of blackberry, jasmine, and benzoin create an alluring, sensual aroma that embodies confidence and modern femininity. A powerful expression of London’s spirit — daring, elegant, and effortlessly captivating.','product_images/1213632.jpg',5,1,10,'','Burberry',NULL),(13,'Aberfeldy Madeira Cask 12 Years Old 70CL',54490.00,'Aberfeldy Madeira Cask 12 Years Old 70CL is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. ABERFELDY Madeira Cask Aged 12 Years is a Classic Highland Single Malt S Enjoy this premium selection, only at Delhi Duty Free.','product_images/ab.jpg',8,1,1,'','Aberfeldy',NULL),(14,'Johnnie Walker Island Green Blended Scotch Whisky 1L Travel Exclusive',7590.00,'Johnnie Walker Island Green Blended Scotch Whisky 1L Travel Exclusive is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. The unique flavour of Johnnie Walker Island Green is achieved by giving Shop at Delhi Duty Free for an unparalleled experience','product_images/j.webp',10,1,1,'','Johnnie Walker',NULL),(15,'Age Defender Moisturiser 75ml',7030.00,'Age Defender Moisturiser 75ml is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. This powerful treatment provides a first line of defense against the effect Find it now at Delhi Duty Free and indulge in luxury.','product_images/k.jpg',5,1,2,'','Skip to the end of the images gallery Skip to the beginning of the images gallery KIEHLS',NULL),(16,'Eye Kohl Smolder',1990.00,'Eye Kohl Smolder is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. MAC Eye Kohl is a soft kohl pencil that lines, defines and shades eyes with A must-have for travelers—shop at Delhi Duty Free. – a must-have.','product_images/mm.jpg',5,1,2,'','MAC',NULL),(17,'Crushed Oil-Infused Gloss - Love Letter',2730.00,'Crushed Oil-Infused Gloss - Love Letter is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. A super-smooth, ultra-hydrating, never-sticky lip gloss in 12 sheer shades Find it now at Delhi Duty Free and indulge in luxury.','product_images/13362838_250.jpg',20,1,2,'','BOBBI BROWN',NULL),(18,'Gucci Cushion de Beauté Foundation - 2.5, 14g (0.49oz)',6200.00,'Gucci Cushion de Beauté Foundation - 2.5, 14g (0.49oz) is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. Gucci Beauty introduces Cushion De Beauté, a luminous and moisturising foun Find it now at Delhi Duty Free and indulge in luxury.','product_images/v.webp',5,1,2,'','GUCCI',NULL),(19,'Lancome Genifique Ultimate Serum',16950.00,'Discover youthful, radiant skin with Lancôme Advanced Génifique Ultimate Serum, powered by cutting-edge microbiome science. This iconic serum strengthens, smooths, and enhances your skin’s glow, revealing visible results in just seven days. A travel must-have for timeless beauty — available now at Delhi Duty Free.','product_images/198486-3.jpg',5,1,2,'','Lancome',NULL),(20,'In Extreme Dimension Waterproof Mascara DIMENSIONAL BLACK',2830.00,'In Extreme Dimension Waterproof Mascara DIMENSIONAL BLACK is a premium offering designed for those who appreciate excellence. Lashes take on superb scale, structure and sweep with In Extreme Dimension Explore this exclusive selection at Delhi Duty Free','product_images/550x722.jpg',2,1,2,'','MAC',NULL),(21,'Ysl Myslf L Absolu',12060.00,'YVES SAINT LAURENT','product_images/yves-saint-laurent-myslf-l-absolu-mens-fragrance.jpg',5,1,10,'','YVES SAINT LAURENT',NULL),(22,'Versace Crystal Noir Parfum',13520.00,'Experience the allure of Versace Crystal Noir Parfum — a sensual fragrance blending luminous floral notes with warm, seductive undertones. This luxurious scent evokes mystery and elegance, perfect for evening wear and unforgettable moments. Housed in a signature glossy bottle, it celebrates confidence, sophistication, and timeless glamour for the modern spirit.','product_images/61LI2-0ErxL._SL1200_.jpg',10,1,10,'','Skip to the end of the images gallery Skip to the beginning of the images gallery VERSACE',NULL),(23,'Kelloggs Pringles Original Potato Chips 70 G',350.00,'Classic, crunchy, and always satisfying – Kellogg’s Pringles Original Potato Chips (70g) are the perfect snack for any occasion. Packed in the iconic resealable can to lock in freshness, these golden crisps deliver the signature Pringles taste and crunch. Great for sharing, traveling, or simply enjoying on your own.','product_images/ayfk065-1_1_1.jpg',10,1,9,'','Kelloggs',NULL),(24,'Honeycomb Chocolate Bar',550.00,'Creamy milk chocolate enhanced by the addition of wonderfully crisp honeycomb pieces.','product_images/1612755007_1.jpg',22,1,9,'','BUTLERS',NULL),(25,'Lindt Milk Almond Pistachio Tablet',2040.00,'Gold Bar Milk Almond Pistachio 300g','product_images/05LIND429166CAZ300G.jpg',10,1,9,'','Lindt',NULL),(26,'Toblerone Tiny Crunchy Almonds Mix',2160.00,'Toblerone Tiny Crunchy Almonds Mix offers bite-sized Swiss milk chocolate pieces with honey and almond nougat, blended with crunchy almond bits for a delightful mix of texture and taste.','product_images/7622202270956_5202223_Confectionery_TobleroneTiny240gCrunchyAlmondsMixbag_1.png',10,1,9,'','Toblerone',NULL),(27,'TRAVELLERS SMALL HAMPER',2970.00,'A delightful hamper filled with an assortment of premium Venchi chocolates, ideal for travel gifting. Beautifully packaged and brimming with variety, it offers a curated taste of Italy in every bite. Perfect for sharing or savoring on special journeys.','product_images/1502128-1.webp',10,1,9,'','VENCHI',NULL),(28,'PISTACHIO SOFT BAR',2420.00,'A soft, creamy bar that blends luscious pistachio paste with Venchi?s premium white chocolate. Smooth, nutty, and utterly indulgent, this bar is a gourmet treat for pistachio lovers seeking a melt-in-the-mouth experience with a luxurious Italian flair.','product_images/1502124_1.webp',10,1,9,'','VENCHI',NULL),(29,'Casio G1756 - GA-B010-3ADR G-Shock Watch',9995.00,'','product_images/OIP_7.jpg',10,1,4,'','Casio',NULL),(30,'Fossil Jesse Rose Gold Watch ES3020 Quartz, Stainless Steel Strap, 34 MM',8899.00,'Elevate your style with this stunning rose gold-tone stainless steel watch. The Jesse watch embodies elegance with a mix of matte and shiny finishes, featuring a three hand movement and a sleek stainless steel bracelet. Our innovative Adjust-O-Matic closure allows for easy self-adjustment of the strap or bracelet, making it the ideal gift that can be worn immediately. Perfect for the modern woman on-the-go, this timepiece is a must-have accessory','product_images/uuu.jpg',10,1,4,'','Fossil',NULL),(31,'Esse Power Bank 3 in1 built-in Cable 10000 Mah, Black',1999.00,'Experience ultimate convenience with the 10000 mAh Polymer Li-ion battery featuring four-way output and dual input ports, along with overcurrent, overvoltage, and short circuit protection. This sleek power bank comes with Type C, Micro USB, and iPhone cables, offering adaptive charging current adjustment and thermal shutdown for overheating prevention. With a compact design, rubber body, smooth edges, and an additional mobile holder, this power bank ensures efficient charging with a 6-7 hours charging time. Enjoy peace of mind with a 6 months manufacturer warranty as you power up your devices on-the-go!','product_images/1_08F04174.jpeg',10,1,3,'','Esse',NULL),(32,'iPhone 11 Pro Max 64GB - Midnight Green',118130.00,'Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max (64 GB) - Midnight Green Style: MWHH2HN/A Features: 6.5-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display. Water and dust resistant (4 meters for up to 30 minutes, IP68). Triple-camera system with 12MP Ultra Wide, Wide, and Telephoto cameras; Night mode, Portrait mode, and 4K video up to 60 fps. 12 MP True Depth front camera with Portrait Mode, 4K video, and Slo-Mo. Face ID for secure authentication and Apple Pay. A13 Bionic chip with third-generation Neural Engine. Fast charge with 18W adapter included. Wireless charging. Technical details: Display: 6.5-inch Super Retina XDR display with HDR and True Tone. Capacity: 64GB. Splash, Water, and Dust Resistant. Water resistant to a depth of 4 metres for up to 30 minutes (IP68). Camera, Video: Triple 12 MP cameras (Ultra Wide, Wide, Telephoto) with Portrait mode, Night mode, Auto Adjustments, next-generation Smart HDR and 4K video up to 60 fps with extended dynamic range. Front Camera: 12 MP True Depth front camera with Portrait mode, Smart HDR, 4K video recording up to 60 fps and Slo-Mo video support for 1080p at 120 fps. Power and Battery: Up to 20 hrs video playback; up to 12 hrs video streaming. Height: 158.0 mm (6.22 inches). Width: 77.8 mm (3.06 inches). Depth: 8.1 mm (0.32 inches). Weight: 226 grams (7.97 ounces).','product_images/08H01481.png',20,1,3,'','Apple',NULL),(33,'iPhone15 Pro, 256 GB, Black Titanium',94990.00,'iPhone15 Pro has a strong and light aerospace grade titanium design with a textured matt-glass back. It also features a Ceramic Shield front that\'s tougher than any smartphone glass. And it\'s splash, water and dust resistant. The 15.54 cm (6.1 in) Super Retina XDR display with ProMotion ramps up refresh rates to 120Hz when you need exceptional graphics performance. Dynamic Island bubbles up alerts and Live Notifications. Plus, with Always-On display, your Lock Screen stays glanceable, so you don\'t have to tap it to stay in the know. A Pro-class GPU makes mobile games feel so immersive, with rich environments and realistic characters. A17 Pro is also incredibly efficient and helps to deliver amazing all-day battery life. Get incredible framing flexibility with 7 pro lenses. Capture super-high-resolution photos with more colour and detail using the 48MP Main camera. And take sharper close-ups from farther away. Action button is a fast track to your favourite feature. Just set the one you want, like Silent mode, Camera, Voice Memo, Shortcut and more. Then press and hold to launch the action. The new USB-C connector lets you charge your Mac or iPad with the same cable you use to charge iPhone 15 Pro. With USB 3, you get a huge leap in data transfer speeds. And you can download files up to 2x faster using Wi-Fi 6E. With Crash Detection, iPhone can detect a severe car crash and call for help if you can\'t. iPhone comes with privacy protections that help keep you in control of your data. It\'s made from more recycled materials to minimise environmental impact. It has built-in features that make iPhone more accessible to all. Every iPhone comes with a one-year limited warranty and up to 90 days of complimentary technical support.','product_images/2_08H01568.jpg',20,1,3,'','Apple',NULL),(34,'iPhone 11 Pro 64GB - Gold',107380.00,'Apple iPhone 11 Pro (64 GB) - Gold Style: MWC52HN/A Capacity: 64 GB Features: 5.8-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display. Water and dust resistant (4 metres for up to 30 minutes, IP68). Triple-camera system with 12 MP Ultra Wide, Wide, and Telephoto cameras; Night mode, Portrait mode, and 4K video up to 60 fps. 12 MP TrueDepth front camera with Portrait mode, 4K video, and Slo-Mo. Face ID for secure authentication and Apple Pay. A13 Bionic chip with third-generation Neural Engine. Fast charge with 18W adapter included. Wireless charging. Technical details: Display: 5.8-inch Super Retina XDR display with HDR and True Tone. Capacity: 64 GB. Splash, Water, and Dust Resistant. Water resistant to a depth of 4 metres for up to 30 minutes (IP68). Camera, Video: Triple 12 MP cameras (Ultra Wide, Wide, Telephoto) with Portrait mode, Night mode, Auto Adjustments, next-generation Smart HDR and 4K video up to 60 fps with extended dynamic range. Front Camera: 12 MP TrueDepth front camera with Portrait mode, Smart HDR, 4K video recording up to 60 fps and Slo-Mo video support for 1080 p at 120 fps. Power and Battery: Up to 18 hours video playback; up to 11 hours video streaming. Height: 144.0 mm (5.67 inches). Width: 71.4 mm (2.81 inches). Depth: 8.1 mm (0.32 inches). Weight: 188 grams (6.63 ounces).','product_images/08H01474.png',20,1,3,'','Apple',NULL),(35,'LEGO classic Crest 1071',1850.00,'LEGO Classic Crest 1071 is a set of building blocks that encourages creative play. It includes over 200 pieces, including colourful bricks and special elements such as doors, windows, wheels and eyes. The included instructions provide ideas for creating models like animals or buildings with the provided parts','product_images/1_22A03575.jpg',10,1,6,'','LEGO',NULL),(36,'LEGO Alphabet Truck Duplo My First',3370.00,'Introduce your little ones to the exciting world of letters and vehicles with the LEGO Alphabet Truck Duplo My First set! This educational and fun-filled toy features a colourful truck, designed to captivate young minds as they learn their ABCs. Each letter comes as a buildable block, making it interactive and engaging. The set also includes adorable character figures that add a touch of playfulness to the learning experience. Crafted from child-safe materials, this LEGO Duplo set ensures hours of safe play. Stimulate creativity and early language skills while exploring the joy of construction with this delightful Alphabet Truck set!','product_images/22A07889.jpg',10,1,6,'','LEGO',NULL),(37,'LEGO Anna and Elses Storybook',2680.00,'Embark on a magical journey with the LEGO Anna and Elsa\'s Storybook set! This enchanting product brings the beloved characters from Disney\'s Frozen to life in a delightful and portable format. Open the book to reveal the sisters\' beautiful castle bedroom, complete with intricate details and accessories. Unleash your creativity as you recreate heartwarming scenes or dream up new adventures for Anna and Elsa. The set includes mini-doll figures, adorable animal companions, and other elements to enhance the storytelling experience. Ideal for imaginative play and display, this LEGO storybook is a must-have for Frozen fans of all ages!','product_images/22A07876.jpg',10,1,6,'','LEGO',NULL),(38,'LEGO AT AT vs.Tauntaun Microfighters Star Wars Tm',2560.00,'Experience the epic battles of the Star Wars universe with the LEGO AT-AT vs. Tauntaun Microfighters set! This thrilling kit brings iconic scenes from Hoth right to your fingertips. Build the agile Tauntaun and the mighty AT-AT walker, then embark on action-packed adventures across the frozen tundra. Take control of your favorite Star Wars characters as they face off in a battle of epic proportions. With its intricate detailing and easy-to-assemble pieces, this LEGO Microfighters set guarantees hours of imaginative play for fans of all ages. Join the rebellion or defend the Galactic Empire - the choice is yours! May the Force be with you','product_images/22A07965.jpg',10,1,6,'','LEGO',NULL),(39,'Alexander McQueen Woman Sunglass AM0126SK-002',27490.00,'Aptly designed for modern women, these Havana sunglasses from Alexander McQueen are a wardrobe must-have. High on style and protection, these sunglasses are surely not to be missed out on. Crafted with care using premium quality acetate, these sunglasses feature bronze lenses and come in a full-rim frame.','product_images/30002249002-CAT-xl.jpg',10,1,4,'','Alexander Mcqueen',NULL),(40,'Alexander McQueen Unisex Sunglass AM0137S-005',26699.00,'These Alexander McQueen sunglasses are an excellent choice for shielding your eyes from the sun. They are made of high-quality metal and are lightweight enough to wear all day. These sunglasses have stylish lenses in a stunning violet colour that will complement all skin tones.','product_images/30002572005-CAT-xl.jpg',10,1,4,'','Alexander Mcqueen',NULL),(41,'Montblanc Urban Spirit Cufflinks - 114770',20699.00,'These cufflinks celebrate understated style and elegance. Round cufflinks made of stainless steel with the snowcap and a Montblanc engraving create a jewel with a powerful Montblanc signature. Metal: Stainless steel. Finish: Polished, matte brushed. Closing: Clip.','product_images/21F02508.png',10,1,4,'','Montblanc',NULL),(42,'Swarovski Attract Trilogy Pendant Chain 5450924',9490.00,'The past, the present, and the future combine in this mesmerizing Attract Trilogy Pendant. Inspired by the concept of eternal love, this romantic design is timelessly elegant. The trio of clear crystals dangle majestically down from the rhodium-plated chain. The perfect gift for a loved one, it is a classic piece full of emotion. A matching pair of pierced earrings and a ring are available.','product_images/09B02224.png',10,1,4,'','Swarovski',NULL),(43,'Swarovski Crystal Remix Moon Charm 5429774',1999.00,'This moon motif charm will bring some bohemian vibes to your look. Plated in rhodium, it shines with clear crystal pave and features a suspended purple crystal for extra sparkle. The easy-to-use, clip-on clasp has been developed especially to fit securely onto any Remix Strand or the new Remix Carrier Bracelet. You could also attach it to any other Swarovski jewelry piece for a customized look with a special meaning. A great gift idea','product_images/09B02377.png',10,1,4,'','Swarovski',NULL),(44,'Guess Cherie Status Carryall Bag - VG711509 COG',10599.00,'Elevate your look with this saffiano faux-leather carryall, featuring front gold-tone studded and logo details. Removable tag keychains, divided interior and zipped exterior pocket. Logo-print lining and interior pockets. Dimensions: 14W x 10.5H x 8D.','product_images/15B04505.png',110,1,4,'','Guess',NULL),(45,'GNC AMP Wheybolic Ripped Chocolate Fudge clinically Proven Protein Thermogenic',8660.00,'Introducing GNC AMP Wheybolic Ripped Chocolate Fudge, the ultimate blend of science and taste for fitness enthusiasts. This clinically proven protein thermogenic supplement is designed to fuel your workouts and help you achieve your fitness goals faster. Packed with premium whey protein, it aids in muscle recovery and growth while supporting fat burning with its thermogenic properties. Indulge in the rich Chocolate Fudge flavour while knowing you\'re getting a potent formula backed by research. Take your fitness journey to the next level with GNC AMP Wheybolic Ripped and experience the power of science-driven performance.','product_images/023456_GNC-AMP-Wheybolic-Ripped-Chocolate-Fudge_Tub.jpg',10,1,7,'','GNC',NULL),(46,'Beyond Raw Lit Gummy Worm clinically Dosed Pre-Workout',3410.00,'Elevate your workout experience with Beyond Raw Lit Gummy Worm Clinically Dosed Pre-Workout. Packed with precision-engineered ingredients, this advanced formula is designed to ignite your performance and push your limits. These gummy worm-flavoured pre-workout supplements offer a delicious and convenient way to fuel your body before hitting the gym. With clinically dosed ingredients, including citrulline, beta-alanine, and caffeine, you can expect enhanced endurance, improved focus, and explosive energy. Unleash your true potential and achieve your fitness goals with Beyond Raw Lit Gummy Worm Clinically Dosed Pre-Workout. Take your workouts to the next level and experience the power within you!','product_images/369926_Beyond_Raw_Lit_Gummy_Worm_Tub.jpg',10,1,7,'','GNC',NULL),(47,'GNC Total Lean Bar Vanilla Birthday Cake High-Protein Meal',370.00,'Indulge in the delightful taste of GNC Total Lean Bar - Vanilla Birthday Cake High-Protein Meal Bar! This scrumptious treat is not just a snack but a complete meal replacement packed with high-quality protein. With every bite, you\'ll enjoy the delicious vanilla birthday cake flavour while fueling your body with essential nutrients and 20 grams of protein to support muscle recovery and weight management. Whether you\'re on-the-go or need a quick and nutritious option, this meal bar is the perfect solution for satisfying hunger and maintaining a healthy lifestyle. Grab yours today and experience a guilt-free, delectable delight!','product_images/496864_web_GNC-Total-Lean-Lean-Bar-Vanilla-Birthday-Cake_Front_Box.jpg',10,1,7,'','GNC',NULL),(48,'Optimum Nutrition Opti-Women, Vitamin C, Zinc and Vitamin D for Immune Support Womens Daily Multivitamin Supplement with Iron, Capsules, 60 Count',1660.00,'Boost your immune system and maintain overall health with Optimum Nutrition Opti-Women. Specifically formulated for women, these daily multivitamin capsules contain essential nutrients such as Vitamin C, Zinc, and Vitamin D to support a strong immune system